{"id":"10c90675676572c7","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage.md","title":"ZFC Inner4 Jensen Hierarchy Stage","display":"df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage — ZFC Inner4 Jensen Hierarchy Stage","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage"],"display":"df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage — ZFC Inner4 Jensen Hierarchy Stage","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage — ZFC Inner4 Jensen Hierarchy Stage"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b31a642a9ecd8d64\" href=\"?note=b31a642a9ecd8d64\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,J_\\alpha,J\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,J_\\alpha,J\\in V\\)</span> (ordinal index, candidate stage, and initial hierarchy function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S\\)</span> (rudimentary-closure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b31a642a9ecd8d64\" href=\"?note=b31a642a9ecd8d64\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S\\)</span> (Jensen-stage predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}jensen\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}stage}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S(\\alpha,J_\\alpha,J)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\alpha+1,\\operatorname{ran}(J))\\land\nJ_\\alpha=J(\\alpha)\\land J(0)=\\emptyset\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\n\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S(J(\\beta+1),J(\\beta))\\Bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)\n\\to J(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}J(\\beta)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}jensen\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}stage}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S(\\alpha,J_\\alpha,J)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\alpha+1,\\operatorname{ran}(J))\\land\nJ_\\alpha=J(\\alpha)\\land J(0)=\\emptyset\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\n\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S(J(\\beta+1),J(\\beta))\\Bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)\n\\to J(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}J(\\beta)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b31a642a9ecd8d64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b31a642a9ecd8d64","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S$ (rudimentary-closure predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,J_\\alpha,J\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}jensen\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}stage}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4JensenHierarchyStage}_S(\\alpha,J_\\alpha,J)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\alpha+1,\\operatorname{ran}(J))\\land\nJ_\\alpha=J(\\alpha)\\land J(0)=\\emptyset\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\n\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S(J(\\beta+1),J(\\beta))\\Bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\alpha+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)\n\\to J(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}J(\\beta)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1533,"backlinks":[{"id":"75ee183e94958e96","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2386","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage.md|58-df-zfc-inner4-jensen-hierarchy-stage]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2","b31a642a9ecd8d64"]}